# A token for a Hetzner project that holds nothing else. Copy this to `.env.hetzner`, put the token
# in, and pass it to one run:
#
#   bun --env-file=.env.hetzner test tests/convex/allocations
#
# Nothing loads this file on its own, which is why the name is not one Bun reads by itself: a plain
# `bun test` must not be able to reach a real project, spend money, or leave anything behind.
# The run makes its own firewall, labels everything it creates, removes all of it at the end, and
# removes what a run that was killed left behind, so anything still in that project is a leak.
HCLOUD_TOKEN=
